#tutor10
From : Colonel K.Rorscham
       Vandaum Headquarters

For : % &
      Island of Piran

Object : LAND AT RIGA-SORO

The fighting between Communists and Capitalists is raging
to the NORTH of Riga-Soro. The communists hold two bases,
but their base to the SOUTH is not defended much. Take
advantage of this to conquer the base and establish
yourselves as quickly as possible.

A landing fleet is waiting for you at the island of Cubliz
to the south of Riga-Soro

Your enemies have combat fighters at their disposal on the
spot.
We are transmitting technological data for the construction
of a air base.

Our control over the the Petra archipelago depends on the
success of this mission. 
Come back only if you are victorious.